{
  "_": [
    "Story two, same machinery. Twelve narration segments, twelve shots.",
    "",
    "The structural invariant here is the RIDE group, not the carry group: the monkey sits",
    "on the crocodile's back, at a saddle point measured off the crocodile's own drawing.",
    "He cannot drift off it, sink into it, or end up behind the animal he is riding.",
    "",
    "THE WIFE IS DRAWN, AND SHE IS A CROCODILE. The first pass kept her a voice from off the",
    "page; the note back was that the evening shots need TWO crocodiles, because a crocodile",
    "talking to nobody reads as a crocodile talking to nobody. So she is on the bank with him",
    "in 04 and 05. What stays elliptical is the harm itself -- she asks, he refuses to like",
    "it, and nothing is ever shown being eaten. docs/14: never braver than the text.",
    "",
    "Every bubble names its speaker with `from`. The builder puts it above them and above",
    "anything standing under it, and film.js fails the shot if it lands on a body."
  ],
